ind":"update","title":"[10.23Demo Update] Art Asset Improvements","summary":"Hello everyone, We received feedback from some players that certain assets in the Demo looked unpolished. We take this seriously and would like to clarify: AI assistance was indeed used in producing some of our game assets. However, all of these assets were manually adjusted before being implemented. Upon review, we realized the refinement on some assets wasn't up to our standards, and we sincerely accept the criticism. This update: • Replaced the news broadcast video on the in-game TV that had ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:18:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036372","verified_at":"2026-10-23T14:49:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4924120-1846018067944133","game_id":"steam-4924120","kind":"update","title":"10.13 Demo Update","summary":"Hey everyone! We’ve updated the Bet You Won’t demo today.After replaying the demo quite a few times and taking a step back, we realized we’d taken some things for granted. What felt obvious to us wasn’t always clear or welcoming to someone playing for the first time.So we’ve made a few small changes to help smooth out the experience and cut down on some of the frustration.October 13, 2026 — Demo UpdateAdded an option to revive on the same in-game day if you die after the prologue.Added the abili","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T14:03:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944133","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4924120-1845383656387626","game_id":"steam-4924120","kind":"announcement","title":"📦 The Bet You Won't Demo Is OUT NOW!","summary":"Hey everyone! 👋Well... we ac